ngs, “P2/Minor findings [are] deferred to follow-up issues.”","id":"33d71fcf4c8442065bc083f034f88f45aedc591e581fcb962a0031ecab8503eb","intervals":[[71,71]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/plist.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Normalize literal line endings before decoding references."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"6977c9cc493d63473e1e81b2d25c103ef5755255","body":"**Reject unrecognized entity references.**\n\nLine 26 leaves unmatched references unchanged. For example, `parsePlist('<plist><string>&unknown;</string></plist>')` returns `\"&unknown;\"` instead of rejecting malformed XML. XML requires undeclared references to fail in this document. ([w3.org](https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/))\n\nValidate each reference before decoding it. Preserve valid escaped text such as `&amp;unknown;`.\n\nBased on learnings, “P2/Minor findings [are] deferred to follow-up issues.”","id":"b62936211c64c703abb6f5990fb131486ed88a02c18a7ed8969fb54f8e9904e1","intervals":[[26,26]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/plist.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Reject unrecognized entity references."}],"head":"227f62d0470d49bded046d0e9716473fea6baa9a","head_tree":"2a6378f38614c8b16a7d30447cf71e2ddc2985f6","input_scope":[{"blob":"3b5ef6b388dfb2497c6dacaf4aa7da0076e1a6f2","intervals":[[1,144]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/deployHealth.ts"},{"blob":"160046285fac3ec7c5af543797a9de5b5523d629","intervals":[[1,131]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/gitGuards.ts"},{"blob":"6977c9cc493d63473e1e81b2d25c103ef5755255","intervals":[[1,184]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/plist.ts"},{"blob":"542ebf195789b7246574f9c6ed856382376a9f94","intervals":[[1,125]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/resolveModules.ts"},{"blob":"00a9f6bcf39d165b7df1cdc89c4329d70399a200","intervals":[[1,114]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/rollbackEvidence.ts"},{"blob":"aa3409d045d80b0a3853cc5d97b5a19c6491dc94","intervals":[[1,195]],"path":"src/ops/crq/deploy/unitCli.ts"},{"blob":"f5455bfe9270a279a0f6de9